(7635087, 1238432, 24454, '<td valign="top">Way to go, Jeb!  This was my favorite in the challenge!  Who IS Randy?  Tell us his story.</td>', 'Way to go, Jeb!  This was my favorite in the challenge!  Who IS Randy?  Tell us his story.', '2019-07-15 10:57:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7635088, 1238086, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Especially after that dehumanizing experience with the first guy!  Ive never had that happen in all the time Ive befriended and photographed people on the street.  Ive only encountered kind people who were grateful for someone seeing them and being interested in spending a little time with them.  I think it might keep me from wanting to do it ever again if I had that experience.  Glad you got a good payoff for trying again!</td>', 'Nice job!  Especially after that dehumanizing experience with the first guy!  Ive never had that happen in all the time Ive befriended and photographed people on the street.  Ive only encountered kind people who were grateful for someone seeing them and being interested in spending a little time with them.  I think it might keep me from wanting to do it ever again if I had that experience.  Glad you got a good payoff for trying again!', '2019-07-15 11:07:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7635089, 1238412, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this portrait so much.  So very award-worthy!  Congratulations!</td>', 'I love this portrait so much.  So very award-worthy!  Congratulations!', '2019-07-15 11:09:19.000000', NULL, 0),
